2. Future Commercial Licensing (Post-GA)
Once Umbrix reaches general availability and paid licensing becomes available,
continued regular use in a commercial environment will require a perpetual
license under the honor-system terms described in COMMERCIAL_AND_LICENSING.md:
- Commercial License: Required when purchased or reimbursed by a company.
- Personal License: For individuals purchasing with personal funds (not
